Pointer resolution: 
```python
def resolve_pointer(root, ptr):
    path, frag = ptr.split('#',1)
    full=os.path.join(root,path)
    doc=yaml.safe_load(open(full))
    cur=doc
    for part in frag.split('.'):
        if isinstance(cur,dict) and part in cur: cur=cur[part]
        else: return False, part
    return True, None
```

